  {
   "level": "analyze",
   "marks": 5,
   "q": "A phased array is set at 10 GHz for a beam 40° off broadside, with fixed phase shifters. Where is the beam at 12 GHz?",
   "a": "For fixed α, the cosine of the angle from the axis scales as 1/f: 0.643 × 10/12 = 0.536, so the beam is 32.4° off broadside. It squints toward broadside."
